  {
   "source_id": "commons:66622448",
   "provider": "Wikimedia Commons",
   "title": "View of Pudong from across the famous Shanghai bund (35634554993).jpg",
   "description": "Our Shanghai Huangpu River Cruise is now well and truly under way, and here we have a clear view of the upcoming Pudong district across from the Bund. The famous Oriental Pearl TV Tower can be seen clearly here. Although there are several cruises available, the 50min cruise I am on now is the most common. The typical route for this cruise is: Shiliupu Wharf near the Bund – Shanghai Tower – Shanghai World Financial Center – Jinmao Tower – Oriental Pearl TV Tower – Yangpu Bridge – Waibaidu Bridge – Monument to the People's Heroes – Peace Hotel – Customs House – back to the wharf. Quite interesting, this cruise, best done at night, which I could not manage unfortunately due to time constraints and the fact that it was drizzling. (Shanghai, China, May 2017)",
   "creator": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
